KATA — Employee Onboarding Approval
=====================================
Scenario:
Build a full stack SAP application where HR submits an employee onboarding request which goes through manager approval via BPA.
Architecture:
Fiori UI → CAP → HANA → BPA → My Inbox
Data Model:
entity OnboardingRequests {
  key ID                          : UUID    @Core.Computed;
  employeeName        : String(100)   not null;
  employeeEmail         : String(100)   not null;
  department               : String enum { HR; IT; Sales; Finance; Operations; } not null;
  role                              : String(100)   not null;
  startDate                     : Date          not null;
  laptopRequired          : Boolean       default false;
  accessCardRequired  : Boolean       default false;
  remarks                        : String(500);
  status                            : String        default 'PENDING';
  createdAt                     : Timestamp     @cds.on.insert : $now;
}
Tasks:
Task 1:  CAP Backend
Created CAP project →  Just fix the issues and,  Replace the env into Destination


Task 2:   BPA Process  
Task 3: BTP Destination
Create BPA_WORKFLOW_EMP destination
Authentication: OAuth2ClientCredentials
Task 4: Fiori UI
Generate List Report Page
Task 5: Deploy to CF
Expected Result:
1	Open Fiori app	List Report loads
2	Click Create	Form opens
3	Fill form + Save	Record saved in HANA
4	Check logs	[BPA] Instance created
5	Open My Inbox	Approval task appears
6	Approve/Reject	Status updates

